<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-BARCELONA 3 AIK STOCKHOLM 1 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BARCELONA 3 AIK STOCKHOLM 1 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barcelona led AIK Stockholm 3-1 in their European Cup Winners' Cup quarter-final first leg match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Barcelona - Gheorghe Popescu 2, Ronaldo 55, Juan Pizzi 75</p>
<p>AIK Stockholm - Pascal Simpson 1</p>
